Master lich's, the Wizard, and numerous Devils do the same trick:
They beat up on you, and when you hurt them, they teleport to the
upstairs and heal.  If you hit them on the stairs, they escape.  To
kill them, you can:
	1) a genocide them (only works on lich's and maybe
demogorgons?) 
	2) hit them with a cockatrice corpse (be sure to be whering
rust proof gloves) 
	3) zap them with a finger of death or wand of death,
	4) or, and this is most common, since the other items are
uncommon, Get to the up stairs of your level and stand on them.  You
can then beat the #$%^ out of the cursed curing fiends, and they will
not teleport away (unless they use a wand or scroll, but if you can't
teleport, they won't be able to teleport this way either)


